{"data": {"event": {"id": "e46e35e3-92e3-44ae-ba96-12a601aeef72", "picture": null, "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance de cas cliniques", "sessionTypeColor": "#44fce7", "voting": true, "title": "S\u00e9ance de cas cliniques :\u00a0 sepsis : erreurs et pi\u00e8ges", "start": "2026-10-10T11:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T12:15+02:00", "objectives": ["<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u00c0 l\u2019issue de cette session, les participants seront capables de :</p>", "<ol data-spread=\"true\" start=\"1\">", "\t<li><strong>Reconna\u00eetre les principales localisations infectieuses \u00e0 l\u2019origine d\u2019un sepsis</strong>, notamment ORL, neurologiques et musculosquelettiques, \u00e0 partir des donn\u00e9es cliniques et radiologiques.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Identifier les principaux pi\u00e8ges et erreurs diagnostiques en imagerie du sepsis</strong>, en sachant distinguer les anomalies infectieuses des diagnostics diff\u00e9rentiels et des signes asp\u00e9cifiques.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Adapter la strat\u00e9gie d\u2019imagerie \u00e0 la situation clinique et au foyer infectieux suspect\u00e9</strong>, afin d\u2019optimiser la d\u00e9tection des complications et de contribuer rapidement \u00e0 la prise en charge.</li>", "</ol>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "628607c6-3f4e-46f9-9bdf-24778538e3f3", "name": "Amphith\u00e9\u00e2tre Bordeaux", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "387a3c28-054b-4a31-afb6-827cb2e79c26", "title": "Fi\u00e8vre d'origine ORL", "start": "2026-10-10T11:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T11:35+02:00", "element": {"abstract": null}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "7e7062e9-8c29-4af8-a7cc-317bd3861977", "lastName": "Beyssen", "firstName": "Philippe", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": null, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Poitiers"}}]}, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}}, {"id": "6826e4dc-57ec-4c4e-82a1-f64f54b25d93", "tit